    },
    "A short one-shot completion summarizes each new chat into a ≤12-char title after the first assistant reply. Set a cheap/fast model here (e.g. `deepseek-chat`, `gpt-4o-mini`, `qwen-turbo`) to avoid burning Pro tokens on titling. Empty → falls back to the active provider's Flash model." : {

