    "Base size (pt) for Agent chat message body and rendered Markdown blocks (paragraphs, lists, quotes, fenced code, tables). Tool-call summaries, footers, message headers, and composer chrome keep their fixed sizes — this knob is about reading the conversation, not resizing the whole UI. Default is 13 pt; range %lld – %lld pt." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Base size (pt) for Agent chat message body and rendered Markdown blocks (paragraphs, lists, quotes, fenced code, tables). Tool-call summaries, footers, message headers, and composer chrome keep their fixed sizes — this knob is about reading the conversation, not resizing the whole UI. Default is 13 pt; range %1$lld – %2$lld pt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Base URL" : {

    },
    "Broad (0%)" : {

    },
    "Cancel" : {

    },
    "Cap on simultaneous Agent turns per provider. Each provider has its own quota — running 3 DashScope sessions doesn't block OpenAI sessions. When the cap is hit, new dispatches queue (FIFO) and drain as turns finish. Raising the cap immediately promotes queued work; lowering it just stops promoting new ones (running turns are never aborted). Default 3 is conservative — bump up if your provider's rate limit comfortably allows." : {

